-*   **Precomputed LOG Volume:** A 3D array of the same dimensions as $V$, storing the Laplacian of Gaussian value for each voxel.
-*   **Thresholds:** Three user-controllable scalar values: $T_{hLOG}$, $T_{heye}$, and $T_{hgrad}$.
